{\normalsize\bfseries\color{ChapterFlame} 關於本書 \;\; \footnotesize\scshape About This Book}

\vspace{0.2cm}
\noindent\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\footnotesize\color{TextGray}
本書逐章研讀使徒行傳二十八章，整合黃長老查經教導、
John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，
並貫通路加福音、保羅書信與啟示錄。
全書以使徒行傳 1:8 為總綱：
「你們就必得著能力，並要在耶路撒冷、猶太全地和撒瑪利亞，
直到地極，作我的見證。」\\[0.4em]
{\itshape
A chapter-by-chapter study of all 28 chapters of Acts,
integrating Elder Wong's teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse
exposition, and G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis —
framed by Acts 1:8's outline: Jerusalem, Judea and Samaria,
and to the end of the earth.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.35cm}

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\centering\vspace{0.18cm}
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{ChapterFlame} 七次重要講道 \;\; Seven Major Speeches}\\[0.3em]
{\footnotesize\color{TextGray}
彼得·五旬節 (2:14-40) \textbullet\ 彼得·所羅門廊 (3:12-26) \textbullet\ 彼得·公會前 (4:8-12)\\
司提反·公會前 (7:2-53) \textbullet\ 保羅·彼西底安提阿 (13:16-41)\\
保羅·亞略巴古 (17:22-31) \textbullet\ 保羅·向亞基帕王 (26:2-29)}
\vspace{0.18cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
